{"suttaId":"thag16.7","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3280,3335],"vripara":"842"},"segments":{"thag16.7:0.4":"Kāḷigodhāputtabhaddiyattheragāthā","thag16.7:1.1":"“Yātaṃ me hatthigīvāya, sukhumā vatthā padhāritā;","thag16.7:1.3":"Sālīnaṃ odano bhutto, sucimaṃsūpasecano.","thag16.7:2.1":"“Sojja bhaddo sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;","thag16.7:2.3":"Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:3.1":"“Paṃsukūlī sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;","thag16.7:3.3":"Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:4.1":"“Piṇḍapātī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:5.1":"“Tecīvarī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:6.1":"“Sapadānacārī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:7.1":"“Ekāsanī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:7.3":"“Pattapiṇḍī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:9.1":"“Khalupacchābhattī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:10.1":"“Āraññiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:11.1":"“Rukkhamūliko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:12.1":"“Abbhokāsī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:13.1":"“Sosāniko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:14.1":"“Yathāsanthatiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:15.1":"“Nesajjiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:16.1":"“Appiccho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:17.1":"“Santuṭṭho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:17.3":"“Pavivitto sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:19.1":"“Asaṃsaṭṭho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:20.1":"“Āraddhavīriyo sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:21.1":"“Hitvā satapalaṃ kaṃsaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ satarājikaṃ;","thag16.7:21.3":"Aggahiṃ mattikāpattaṃ, idaṃ dutiyābhisecanaṃ.","thag16.7:22.1":"“Ucce maṇḍalipākāre, daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhake;","thag16.7:22.3":"Rakkhito khaggahatthehi, uttasaṃ vihariṃ pure.","thag16.7:23.1":"“Sojja bhaddo anutrāsī, pahīnabhayabheravo;","thag16.7:23.3":"Jhāyati vanamogayha, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:24.1":"“Sīlakkhandhe patiṭṭhāya, satiṃ paññañca bhāvayaṃ;","thag16.7:24.3":"Pāpuṇiṃ anupubbena, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayan”ti.","thag16.7:24.5":"… Bhaddiyo kāḷigodhāya putto thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":3987,"to":3990,"paras":[{"para":3987,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag16.7:24"],"lines":["Tattha <b>yātaṃ me hatthigīvāyā</b>ti, bhante, pubbe mayā gacchantenāpi hatthigīvāya hatthikkhandhe nisīditvā yātaṃ caritaṃ.","Vatthāni pariharantenāpi <b>sukhumā</b> sukhasamphassā kāsikavatthavisesā dhāritā.","Odanaṃ bhuñjantenāpi tivassikānaṃ purāṇagandhasālīnaṃ odano tittirakapiñjarādinā sucinā maṃsena upasittatāya <b>sucimaṃsūpasecano</b> bhutto, tathāpi taṃ sukhaṃ na mayhaṃ cittaparitosakaraṃ ahosi, yathā etarahi vivekasukhanti dassento āha <b>“sojja bhaddo”</b>tiādi.","Ettha ca hatthiggahaṇeneva assarathayānāni, vatthaggahaṇena sabbarājālaṅkārā, odanaggahaṇena sabbabhojanavikati gahitāti veditabbaṃ.","<b>Sojjā</b>ti so ajja etarahi pabbajjāyaṃ ṭhito.","<b>Bhaddo</b>ti sīlādiguṇehi samannāgatattā bhaddo.","<b>Sātatiko</b>ti samaṇadhamme diṭṭhadhammasukhavihāre sātaccayutto.","<b>Uñchāpattāgate rato</b>ti uñchācariyāya patte āgate pattapariyāpanne abhirato, teneva santuṭṭhoti adhippāyo.","<b>Jhāyatī</b>ti phalasamāpattijhānena jhāyati.","<b>Putto godhāyā</b>ti kāḷigodhāya nāma khattiyāya putto.","<b>Bhaddiyo</b>ti evaṃnāmo attānameva thero aññaṃ viya katvā vadati."],"lineRefs":[["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"]]},{"para":3988,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag16.7:24"],"lines":["Gahapaticīvaraṃ paṭikkhipitvā paṃsukūlikaṅgasamādānena <b>paṃsukūliko</b>.","Saṅghabhattaṃ paṭikkhipitvā piṇḍapātikaṅgasamādānena <b>piṇḍapātiko</b>.","Atirekacīvaraṃ paṭikkhipitvā tecīvarikaṅgasamādānena <b>tecīvariko</b>.","Loluppacāraṃ paṭikkhipitvā sapadānacārikaṅgasamādānena <b>sapadānacārī</b>.","Nānāsanabhojanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā ekāsanikaṅgasamādānena <b>ekāsaniko</b>.","Dutiyakabhājanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā pattapiṇḍikaṅgasamādānena <b>pattapiṇḍiko</b>.","Atirittabhojanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā khalupacchābhattikaṅgasamādānena <b>khalupacchābhattiko</b>.","Gāmantasenāsanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā āraññikaṅgasamādānena <b>āraññiko</b>.","Channavāsaṃ paṭikkhipitvā rukkhamūlikaṅgasamādānena <b>rukkhamūliko</b>.","Channarukkhamūlāni paṭikkhipitvā abbhokāsikaṅgasamādānena <b>abbhokāsiko</b>.","Nasusānaṃ paṭikkhipitvā sosānikaṅgasamādānena <b>sosāniko</b>.","Senāsanaloluppaṃ paṭikkhipitvā yathāsanthatikaṅgasamādānena <b>yathāsanthatiko</b>.","Sayanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā nesajjikaṅgasamādānena <b>nesajjiko</b>.","Ayamettha saṅkhepo.","Vitthārato pana dhutaṅgakathā <b>visuddhimagge</b> (visuddhi.1.22 ādayo) vuttanayeneva gahetabbā."],"lineRefs":[["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"]]},{"para":3989,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag16.7:24"],"lines":["<b>Ucce</b>ti uccādiṭṭhāne, uparipāsādatāya vā ucce.","<b>Maṇḍalipākāre</b>ti maṇḍalākārena pākāraparikkhitte.","<b>Daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhake</b>ti thirehi aṭṭālehi dvārakoṭṭhakehi ca samannāgate, nagareti attho."],"lineRefs":[["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"]]},{"para":3990,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag16.7:24"],"lines":["<b>Satiṃ paññañcā</b>ti ettha satisīsena samādhiṃ vadati.","Phalasamāpattinirodhasamāpattiyo sandhāya “satiṃ paññañca bhāvayan”ti vutto.","Sesaṃ tattha tattha vuttanayattā uttānameva."],"lineRefs":[["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag16.7:24.5","bhaddo",0,5],["thag16.7:24.5","bhaddiyo",0,10],["thag16.7:24.1","satiṃ paññañcā",3,0]],"before":[{"para":3722,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Evañca vatvā “etha, bhikkhavo”ti bhagavā avoca.","Tāvadeva te sabbe iddhimayapattacīvaradharā hutvā saṭṭhivassikattherā viya bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā parivāresuṃ.","So evaṃ pabbajitvā vipassanāya kammaṃ karonto sattame divase sapariso arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.40.208-303)–"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[]]},{"para":3723,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, vīthisāmī ahosahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3724,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mama ñātī samānetvā, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3725,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Buddho loke samuppanno, puññakkhetto anuttaro;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3726,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Āsi so sabbalokassa, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3727,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Khattiyā negamā ceva, mahāsālā ca brāhmaṇā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3728,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3729,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Hatthārohā anīkaṭṭhā, rathikā pattikārakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3730,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3731,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Uggā ca rājaputtā ca, vesiyānā ca brāhmaṇā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3732,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3733,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Āḷārikā kappakā ca, nhāpakā mālakārakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3734,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3735,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Rajakā pesakārā ca, cammakārā ca nhāpitā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3736,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3737,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Usukārā bhamakārā, cammakārā ca tacchakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3738,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3739,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kammārā soṇṇakārā ca, tipulohakarā tathā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3740,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pasannacittā sumanā, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3741,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Bhatakā ceṭakā ceva, dāsakammakarā bahū;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3742,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yathāsakena thāmena, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3743,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Udahārā kaṭṭhahārā, kassakā tiṇahārakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3744,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yathāsakena thāmena, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3745,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pupphikā mālikā ceva, paṇṇikā phalahārakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3746,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yathāsakena thāmena, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3747,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gaṇikā kumbhadāsī ca, pūvikā macchikāpi ca;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3748,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yathāsakena thāmena, pūgadhammaṃ akaṃsu te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3749,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Etha sabbe samāgantvā, gaṇaṃ bandhāma ekato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3750,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Adhikāraṃ karissāma, puññakkhette anuttare."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3751,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Te me sutvāna vacanaṃ, gaṇaṃ bandhiṃsu tāvade;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3752,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Upaṭṭhānasālaṃ sukataṃ, bhikkhusaṅghassa kārayuṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3753,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Niṭṭhāpetvāna taṃ sālaṃ, udaggo tuṭṭhamānaso;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3754,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pareto tehi sabbehi, sambuddhamupasaṅkamiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3755,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Upasaṅkamma sambuddhaṃ, lokanāthaṃ narāsabhaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3756,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vanditvā satthuno pāde, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3757,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ime tīṇi satā vīra, purisā ekato gaṇā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3758,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Upaṭṭhānasālaṃ sukataṃ, niyyādenti tuvaṃ muni."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3759,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Bhikkhusaṅghassa purato, sampaṭicchatva cakkhumā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3760,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tiṇṇaṃ satānaṃ purato, imā gāthā abhāsatha."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3761,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tisatāpi ca jeṭṭho ca, anuvattiṃsu ekato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3762,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sampattiñhi karitvāna, sabbe anubhavissatha."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3763,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pacchime bhave sampatte, sītibhāvamanuttaraṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3764,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ajaraṃ amataṃ santaṃ, nibbānaṃ phassayissatha."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3765,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Evaṃ buddho viyākāsi, sabbaññū samaṇuttaro;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3766,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Buddhassa vacanaṃ sutvā, somanassaṃ pavedayiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3767,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tiṃsakappasahassāni, devaloke ramiṃ ahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3768,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Devādhipo pañcasataṃ, devarajjamakārayiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3769,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sahassakkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3770,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Devarajjaṃ karontassa, mahādevā avandisuṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3771,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Idha mānusake rajjaṃ, parisā honti bandhavā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3772,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pacchime bhave sampatte, vāseṭṭho nāma brāhmaṇo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3773,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Asītikoṭi nicayo, tassa putto ahosahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3774,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Selo iti mamaṃ nāmaṃ, chaḷaṅge pāramiṃ gato."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3775,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Jaṅghāvihāraṃ vicaraṃ, sasissehi purakkhato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3776,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jaṭābhārikabharitaṃ, keṇiyaṃ nāma tāpasaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3777,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Paṭiyattāhutiṃ disvā, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3778,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Āvāho vā vivāho vā, rājā vā te nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3779,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Āhutiṃ yiṭṭhukāmohaṃ, brāhmaṇe devasammate;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3780,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Na nimantemi rājānaṃ, āhutī me na vijjati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3781,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Na catthi mayhamāvāho, vivāho me na vijjati;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3782,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sakyānaṃ nandijanano, seṭṭho loke sadevake."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3783,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sabbalokahitatthāya, sabbasattasukhāvaho;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3784,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["So me nimantito ajja, tassetaṃ paṭiyādanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3785,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Timbarūsakavaṇṇābho, appameyyo anūpamo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3786,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Rūpenāsadiso buddho, svātanāya nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3787,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ukkāmukhapahaṭṭhova, khadiraṅgārasannibho;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3788,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vijjūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3789,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pabbatagge yathā acci, puṇṇamāyeva candimā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3790,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Naḷaggivaṇṇasaṅkāso, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3791,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Asambhīto bhayātīto, bhavantakaraṇo muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3792,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sīhūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3793,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kusalo buddhadhammehi, apasayho parehi so;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3794,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Nāgūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3795,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Saddhammācārakusalo, buddhanāgo asādiso;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3796,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Usabhūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3797,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Anantavaṇṇo amitayaso, vicittasabbalakkhaṇo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3798,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sakkūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3799,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Vasī gaṇī patāpī ca, tejassī ca durāsado;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3800,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Brahmūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3801,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pattadhammo dasabalo, balātibalapārago;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3802,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dharaṇūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3803,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sīlavīcisamākiṇṇo, dhammaviññāṇakhobhito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3804,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Udadhūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3805,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Durāsado duppasaho, acalo uggato brahā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3806,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Nerūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3807,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Anantañāṇo asamasamo, atulo aggataṃ gato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3808,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Gaganūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3809,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Patiṭṭhā bhayabhītānaṃ, tāṇo saraṇagāminaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3810,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Assāsako mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3811,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Āsayo buddhimantānaṃ, puññakkhettaṃ sukhesinaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3812,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ratanākaro mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3813,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Assāsako vedakaro, sāmaññaphaladāyako;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3814,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Meghūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3815,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Lokacakkhu mahātejo, sabbatamavinodano;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3816,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sūriyūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3817,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ārammaṇavimuttīsu, sabhāvadassano muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3818,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Candūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3819,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Buddho samussito loke, lakkhaṇehi alaṅkato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3820,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Appameyyo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3821,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yassa ñāṇaṃ appameyyaṃ, sīlaṃ yassa anūpamaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3822,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vimutti asadisā yassa, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3823,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yassa dhīti asadisā, thāmo yassa acintiyo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3824,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Yassa parakkamo jeṭṭho, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3825,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Rāgo doso ca moho ca, visā sabbe samūhatā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3826,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Agadūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3827,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Klesabyādhibahudukkha-sabbatamavinodano;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3828,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vejjūpamo mahāvīro, so me buddho nimantito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3829,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Buddhoti bho yaṃ vadesi, ghosopeso sudullabho;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3830,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Buddho buddhoti sutvāna, pīti me udapajjatha."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3831,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Abbhantaraṃ agaṇhantaṃ, pīti me bahi nicchare;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3832,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sohaṃ pītimano santo, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3833,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kahaṃ nu kho so bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3834,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tattha gantvā namassissaṃ, sāmaññaphaladāyakaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3835,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Paggayha dakkhiṇaṃ bāhuṃ, vedajāto katañjalī;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3836,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ācikkhi me dhammarājaṃ, sokasallavinodanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3837,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Udentaṃva mahāmeghaṃ, nīlaṃ añjanasannibhaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3838,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sāgaraṃ viya dissantaṃ, passasetaṃ mahāvanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3839,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ettha so vasate buddho, adantadamako muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3840,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vinayanto ca veneyye, bodhento bodhipakkhiye."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3841,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pipāsitova udakaṃ, bhojanaṃva jighacchito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3842,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Gāvī yathā vacchagiddhā, evāhaṃ viciniṃ jinaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3843,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ācāraupacāraññū, dhammānucchavisaṃvaraṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3844,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sikkhāpemi sake sisse, gacchante jinasantikaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3845,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Durāsadā bhagavanto, sīhāva ekacārino;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3846,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pade padaṃ nikkhipantā, āgaccheyyātha māṇavā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3847,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Āsīviso yathā ghoro, migarājāva kesarī;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3848,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mattova kuñjaro dantī, evaṃ buddhā durāsadā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3849,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ukkāsitañca khipitaṃ, ajjhupekkhiya māṇavā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3850,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pade padaṃ nikkhipantā, upetha buddhasantikaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3851,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Paṭisallānagarukā, appasaddā durāsadā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3852,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Durūpasaṅkamā buddhā, garū honti sadevake."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3853,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yadāhaṃ pañhaṃ pucchāmi, paṭisammodayāmi vā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3854,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Appasaddā tadā hotha, munibhūtāva tiṭṭhatha."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3855,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yaṃ so deseti sambuddho, khemaṃ nibbānapattiyā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3856,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tamevatthaṃ nisāmetha, saddhammasavanaṃ sukhaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3857,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Upasaṅkamma sambuddhaṃ, sammodiṃ muninā ahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3858,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Taṃ kathaṃ vītisāretvā, lakkhaṇe upadhārayiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3859,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Lakkhaṇe dve ca kaṅkhāmi, passāmi tiṃsalakkhaṇe;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3860,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kosohitavatthaguyhaṃ, iddhiyā dassayī muni."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3861,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Jivhaṃ ninnāmayitvāna, kaṇṇasote ca nāsike;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3862,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṭimasi nalāṭantaṃ, kevalaṃ chādayī jino."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3863,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tassāhaṃ lakkhaṇe disvā, paripuṇṇe sabyañjane;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3864,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Buddhoti niṭṭhaṃ gantvāna, saha sissehi pabbajiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3865,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Satehi tīhi sahito, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3866,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aḍḍhamāse asampatte, sabbe pattāmha nibbutiṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3867,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ekato kammaṃ katvāna, puññakkhette anuttare;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3868,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ekato saṃsaritvāna, ekato vinivattayuṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3869,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gopānasiyo datvāna, pūgadhamme vasiṃ ahaṃ"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3870,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tena kammena sukatena, aṭṭha hetū labhāmahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3871,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Disāsu pūjito homi, bhogā ca amitā mama;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3872,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Patiṭṭhā homi sabbesaṃ, tāso mama na vijjati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3873,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Byādhayo me na vijjanti, dīghāyuṃ pālayāmi ca;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3874,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sukhumacchaviko homi, āvāse patthite vase."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3875,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Aṭṭha gopānasī datvā, pūgadhamme vasiṃ ahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3876,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṭisambhidārahattañca, etaṃ me aparaṭṭhamaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3877,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sabbavositavosāno, katakicco anāsavo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3878,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aṭṭha gopānasī nāma, tava putto mahāmuni."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3879,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pañca thambhāni datvāna, pūgadhamme vasiṃ ahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3880,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tena kammena sukatena, pañca hetū labhāmahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3881,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Acalo homi mettāya, anūnaṅgo bhavāmahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3882,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ādeyyavacano homi, na dhaṃsemi yathā ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3883,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Abhantaṃ hoti me cittaṃ, akhilo homi kassaci;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3884,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tena kammena sukatena, vimalo homi sāsane."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3885,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sagāravo sappatisso, katakicco anāsavo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3886,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sāvako te mahāvīra, bhikkhu taṃ vandate muni."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3887,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Katvā sukatapallaṅkaṃ, sālāyaṃ paññapesahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3888,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tena kammena sukatena, pañca hetū labhāmahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3889,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ucce kule pajāyitvā, mahābhogo bhavāmahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3890,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sabbasampattiko homi, maccheraṃ me na vijjati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3891,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Gamane patthite mayhaṃ, pallaṅko upatiṭṭhati;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3892,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Saha pallaṅkaseṭṭhena, gacchāmi mama patthitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3893,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tena pallaṅkadānena, tamaṃ sabbaṃ vinodayiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3894,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sabbābhiññābalappatto, thero vandati taṃ muni."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3895,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Parikiccattakiccāni, sabbakiccāni sādhayiṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3896,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tena kammena sukatena, pāvisiṃ abhayaṃ puraṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3897,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Pariniṭṭhitasālamhi, paribhogamadāsahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3898,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tena kammena sukatena, seṭṭhattaṃ ajjhupāgato."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3899,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ye keci damakā loke, hatthiasse damenti ye;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3900,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Karitvā kāraṇā nānā, dāruṇena damenti te."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3901,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Na hevaṃ tvaṃ mahāvīra, damesi naranāriyo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3902,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Adaṇḍena asatthena, damesi uttame dame."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3903,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Dānassa vaṇṇe kittento, desanākusalo muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3904,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ekapañhaṃ kathentova, bodhesi tisate muni."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3905,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Dantā mayaṃ sārathinā, suvimuttā anāsavā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3906,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sabbābhiññābalapattā, nibbutā upadhikkhaye."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3907,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3908,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Atikkantā bhayā sabbe, sālādānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3909,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3910,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvā satthāraṃ upasaṅkamitvā aññaṃ byākaronto –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3912,"vripara":"838","refs":[],"lines":["“Yaṃ taṃ saraṇamāgamha, ito aṭṭhame cakkhuma;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3913,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sattarattena bhagavā, dantāmha tava sāsane”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":3914,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tassattho – pañcahi cakkhūhi <b>cakkhuma</b> bhagavā yasmā mayaṃ ito atīte <b>aṭṭhame</b> divase taṃ saraṇaṃ <b>agamimha</b>.","Tasmā sattarattena tava sāsane damakena <b>dantā amha,</b> aho <b>te</b> saraṇagamanassa ānubhāvoti.","Tato paraṃ –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[]]},{"para":3916,"vripara":"839","refs":[],"lines":["“Tuvaṃ buddho tuvaṃ satthā, tuvaṃ mārābhibhū muni;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3917,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tuvaṃ anusaye chetvā, tiṇṇo tāresimaṃ pajaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3919,"vripara":"840","refs":[],"lines":["“Upadhī te samatikkantā, āsavā te padālitā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3920,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sīhova anupādāno, pahīnabhayabheravo”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":3921,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Imāhi dvīhi gāthāhi abhitthavitvā osānagāthāya satthāraṃ vandanaṃ yācati –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3923,"vripara":"841","refs":[],"lines":["“Bhikkhavo tisatā ime, tiṭṭhanti pañjalīkatā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3924,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pāde vīra pasārehi, nāgā vandantu satthuno”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3925,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tattha <b>tuvaṃ buddho</b>ti tvameva imasmiṃ loke sabbaññubuddho.","Diṭṭhadhammikādiatthena sattānaṃ anusāsanato tvameva <b>satthā</b>.","Sabbesaṃ mārānaṃ abhibhavanato <b>mārābhibhū</b>.","Munibhāvato <b>muni.</b>","<b>Anusaye chetvā</b>ti kāmarāgādike anusaye ariyamaggasatthena chinditvā.","<b>Tiṇṇo</b>ti sayaṃ saṃsāramahoghaṃ tiṇṇo, desanāhatthena imaṃ <b>pajaṃ</b> sattakāyaṃ tāresi.","<b>Upadhī</b>ti khandhūpadhiādayo sabbe upadhī.","<b>Adupādāno</b>ti sabbaso pahīnakāmupādānādiko.","Evaṃ vatvā thero sapariso satthāraṃ abhivandatīti."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":3926,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Selattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3927,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kāḷigodhāputtabhaddiyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3928,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Yātaṃ me hatthigīvāyā</b>tiādikā āyasmato bhaddiyattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle mahābhogakule nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patto ekadivasaṃ satthu santike dhammaṃ suṇanto satthārā ekaṃ bhikkhuṃ uccākulikānaṃ aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapiyamānaṃ disvā sayampi taṃ ṭhānantaraṃ patthetvā sattāhaṃ buddhappamukhassa bhikkhusaṅghassa mahādānaṃ datvā paṇidhānaṃ akāsi.","Satthāpissa anantarāyena samijjhanabhāvaṃ disvā byākāsi.","Sopi taṃ byākaraṇaṃ sutvā uccākulikasaṃvattanikaṃ kammaṃ pucchitvā dhammassavanassa kārāpanaṃ, dhammamaṇḍape āsanadānaṃ, bījanīdānaṃ, dhammakathikānaṃ pūjāsakkārakaraṇaṃ, uposathāgāre paṭissayadānanti evamādiṃ yāvajīvaṃ bahupuññaṃ katvā tato cuto devamanussesu saṃsaranto kassapassa bhagavato aparabhāge amhākaṃ bhagavato uppattiyā puretaraṃ bārāṇasiyaṃ kuṭumbiyaghare nibbatto sambahule paccekabuddhe piṇḍāya caritvā ekasmiṃyeva ṭhāne samāgantvā bhattavissaggaṃ karonte disvā tattha pāsāṇaphalakāni attharitvā pādodakādiṃ upaṭṭhapento yāvajīvaṃ upaṭṭhahi."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":3929,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["So ekaṃ buddhantaraṃ devamanussesu saṃsaritvā imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kapilavatthunagare sākiyarājakule nibbatti, <b>bhaddiyo</b>tissa nāmaṃ ahosi.","So vayappatto anuruddhādīhi pañcahi khattiyehi saddhiṃ satthari anupiyambavane viharante satthu santike pabbajitvā arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Taṃ satthā aparabhāge jetavane ariyagaṇamajjhe nisinno uccākulikānaṃ bhikkhūnaṃ aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapesi.","So phalasukhena nibbānasukhena ca vītināmento araññagatopi rukkhamūlagatopi suññāgāragatopi “aho sukhaṃ, aho sukhan”ti abhikkhaṇaṃ udānaṃ udānesi.","Taṃ sutvā bhikkhū satthu ārocesuṃ –","“āyasmā bhaddiyo kāḷigodhāya putto abhikkhaṇaṃ ‘aho sukhaṃ, aho sukhan’ti vadati, anabhirato maññe brahmacariyaṃ caratī”ti.","Satthā taṃ pakkosāpetvā “saccaṃ kira tvaṃ, bhaddiya, abhikkhaṇaṃ ‘aho sukhaṃ, aho sukhan’ti vadasī”ti pucchi.","So “saccaṃ bhagavā”ti paṭijānitvā “pubbe me, bhante, rajjaṃ kārentassa susaṃvihitārakkho ahosiṃ, tathāpi bhīto ubbiggo ussaṅkito vihāsiṃ.","Idāni pana pabbajito abhīto anubbiggo anussaṅkito viharāmī”ti vatvā –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":3931,"vripara":"842","refs":[],"lines":["“Yātaṃ me hatthigīvāya, sukhumā vatthā padhāritā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3932,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sālīnaṃ odano bhutto, sucimaṃsūpasecano."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3934,"vripara":"843","refs":[],"lines":["“Sojja bhaddo sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3935,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3937,"vripara":"844","refs":[],"lines":["“Paṃsukūlī sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3938,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3941,"vripara":"845","refs":[],"lines":["“Piṇḍapātī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3943,"vripara":"846","refs":[],"lines":["“Tecīvarī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3945,"vripara":"847","refs":[],"lines":["“Sapadānacārī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3947,"vripara":"848","refs":[],"lines":["“Ekāsanī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3949,"vripara":"849","refs":[],"lines":["“Pattapiṇḍī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3951,"vripara":"850","refs":[],"lines":["“Khalupacchābhattī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3953,"vripara":"851","refs":[],"lines":["“Āraññiko sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3955,"vripara":"852","refs":[],"lines":["“Rukkhamūliko sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3957,"vripara":"853","refs":[],"lines":["“Abbhokāsī sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3959,"vripara":"854","refs":[],"lines":["“Sosāniko sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3961,"vripara":"855","refs":[],"lines":["“Yathāsanthatiko sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3963,"vripara":"856","refs":[],"lines":["“Nesajjiko sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3965,"vripara":"857","refs":[],"lines":["“Appiccho sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3967,"vripara":"858","refs":[],"lines":["“Santuṭṭho sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3969,"vripara":"859","refs":[],"lines":["“Pavivitto sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3971,"vripara":"860","refs":[],"lines":["“Asaṃsaṭṭho sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3973,"vripara":"861","refs":[],"lines":["“Āraddhavīriyo sātatiko … pe …."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3975,"vripara":"862","refs":[],"lines":["“Hitvā satapalaṃ kaṃsaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ satarājikaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3976,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aggahiṃ mattikāpattaṃ, idaṃ dutiyābhisecanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3978,"vripara":"863","refs":[],"lines":["“Ucce maṇḍalipākāre, daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhake;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3979,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Rakkhito khaggahatthehi, uttamaṃ vihariṃ pure."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3981,"vripara":"864","refs":[],"lines":["“Sojja bhaddo anutrāsī, pahīnabhayabheravo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3982,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jhāyati vanamogayha, putto godhāya bhaddiyo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3984,"vripara":"865","refs":[],"lines":["“Sīlakkhandhe patiṭṭhāya, satiṃ paññañca bhāvayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3985,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pāpuṇiṃ anupubbena, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":3986,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Imāhi gāthāhi satthu purato sīhanādaṃ nadi."],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
